{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1378630-princes-of-the-earth-show-us-your-dual-techs","id":1378630,"title":"Princes of the Earth, show us your Dual Techs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-04T16:26:34-07:00","id":1378630,"title":"Princes of the Earth, show us your Dual Techs","content":"For those of you who have Dragon-Blooded characters in primarily Dragon-Blooded games, or who run such games...<br /> <br /> Tell us how your characters or players would use Tiger-and-Dragon Combination and Twin Dragons Dancing.<br /> <br /> If they don't yet meet the necessary War and Essence minimums, waive that for the purpose of the exercise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T01:30:00-07:00","id":1378697,"title":"","content":"Pure fantasy as my Essence 3 Deeb has exactly 0 dots in War. But...<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Mnemon Danireya regards the Anathema with cold contempt. The frozen chill of her icy Anima is palpable.<br /> <br /> &quot;This has gone on long enough!&quot; She bellows over the icy wind whipping around her, &quot;Amilar Shavok, for your crimes against the Dragon-Blooded Host I sentence you to death!&quot;<br /> <br /> Beside her, Cynis Ganan, her husband, darts forward. His Anima a raging sandstorm. His Aura adds great rocks to the swirling debris surrounding him.<br /> <br /> Ganan draws back his tetsubo as he charges forward. His Anima takes the rough shape of a man, &quot;You line him up!&quot; He roars with the force of an avalanche...<br /> <br /> Danireya speaks the Burning Name, sending a blast of flame over Ganan's shoulder to strike at Shavok as her Aura collapses and her Anima flares, icy snowflakes coalescing into a Mandela pattern, &quot;And you knock them down!&quot; She rejoins.<br /> <br /> Ganan's tetsubo smashes into the Mad Sorcerers side, just as Danireya's flames scorch the Anathema, forcing him to flinch into the blow. Ganan strikes with the Force of the Mountain, and he spins rapidly in place to deliver a second below on the patch of skin burned by Danireya's attack.<br /> <br /> Ganan feels the satisfying crunch of broken bones as the beaten and burned sorcerer is flung a clear fifty yards back and falls to the ground like a savaged ragdoll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T23:20:34-07:00","id":1380036,"title":"","content":"<b>Crackling Lightning Stake</b><br /> <br /> Two masters of thrown, one Earth and one Air. First the Earth aspect hurls a knife into the enemy with Stone Needle Strike and Armor-Rupturing Fang, pinning them to the ground and rupturing their armor open. Then the master of wind calls down lightning from the sky using Elemental Bolt Attack, Arcing Levinbolt Precision, and Winter Fang Attack driving the bolt of lighting to the heart of the foe through the impaled lightning rod.<br /> <br /> <b>Descending Comet Blow</b><br /> <br /> An Earth aspected brawler striking a target with Rolling Boulder Blow, knocking an enemy back and prone, and then descending from a point above a Fire aspect brawler leaps down with her fist and smashes into them with Falling Star Maneuver, creating a fiery explosion. Before Essence 5 just don't use Falling Star Maneuver and fluff it as a smaller explosion.<br /> <br /> <b>Airborn Snapshot</b><br /> <br /> An air aspected immaculate monk hurls an opponent skyward with a massive updraft and in mid air a wood aspected archer picks them out of the sky with an essence laden arrow. Use Avenging Wind Strike and Arrow Thorn Technique for best effect.<br /> <br /> <b>Double Dragon Helix</b><br /> <br /> Literally just any two combinations of Elemental Bolt Attack, flavoured as the two characters standing back to back, arms outstretched, two twisting dragons made of essence flying out towards their target.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-10T00:01:40-07:00","id":1380042,"title":"","content":"Admittedly this was a <i>Solar</i> and a Dragon-Blooded using a combo attack, but it still feels pretty appropriate to the thread.<br /> ____________________________________________<br /> <br /> Kithri rushes forward at full sprint. With a flash of anima, the ground around her melted and the fiery aura that now surrounded her coalesced into Burning Oversoul. As soon as Kithri came into range her cracked like thunder booming over the chaos of battle.<br /> <br /> &quot;Shore up your defenses! Alternate between polearms and others using swords and axes to enact a bladewall. Anything that gets closer should be shredded by those with swords, axes, and hammers! Let them break upon the mountain!&quot;<br /> <br /> Kithri's voice carried a steadiness about it that both calmed and strengthened the defenders. Not following her own orders, she leaps over the defending line to begin to carve out a hole in the attacker's advancing line.<br /> <br /> Knight Raiton plucks one of the ironwood boomerangs out of his winter coat and winds back his throwing arm, a glint of sunlight playing along it despite the winter weather. Once his aim is fixed, he lets fly, and the curved wooden blade passes through Kithri's burning anima at the apex of her jump, catching alight as it does so. As the burning boomerang arcs near the horde of creatures, it splits off into a dozen, then a thousand phantasmal projectiles, each carrying the fire of the Dragon-Blooded's anima and the light of the sun as it cuts through the enemy army.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}